flowchart TD
    MENU[CLI menu selects download callback] --> DLCITY[dlcity]
    DLCITY --> SELECT[download_menu]
    SELECT --> MODE{Selected mode?}
    MODE -->|Place search| SEARCH[Return selected place and bbox]
    MODE -->|Manual bbox| CUSTOM[get_custom_bbox returns empty place and bbox]
    MODE -->|Cancel| CANCEL[Return empty place and no bbox]
    SEARCH --> GUARD{place and bbox truthy?}
    CUSTOM --> GUARD
    CANCEL --> GUARD
    GUARD -->|No| EARLY[Return before download; current_map is not cleared here]
    GUARD -->|Yes| CONVERT[require_domain_bounding_box]
    CONVERT[Convert to domain BoundingBox; new/coerced values check finite ordered limits; existing instance is returned as-is]
    CONVERT -->|Conversion or new-value validation raises| BBOX_ERROR[ValueError escapes before layer handlers]
    CONVERT -->|Accepted or existing instance| CRS{Explicit CRS differs from EPSG:4326?}
    CRS -->|No or missing| USE_INPUT[Keep bounds; missing CRS is treated as geographic by caller convention]
    CRS -->|Yes| REPROJECT[Try reproject to EPSG:4326]
    REPROJECT -->|Success| USE_REPROJECTED[Use reprojected bbox]
    REPROJECT -->|Failure| WARN[Warn; retain original bbox]
    USE_INPUT --> BUNDLE_CACHE{Valid whole-bundle cache?}
    USE_REPROJECTED --> BUNDLE_CACHE
    WARN --> BUNDLE_CACHE
    BUNDLE_CACHE -->|Valid hit| RETURN_BUNDLE[Return cached bundle]
    BUNDLE_CACHE -->|Miss, unreadable, or invalid| REQUEST_TUPLE[_bbox_to_osmnx_tuple]
    REQUEST_TUPLE -->|CRS reprojection raises| PRELAYER_ERROR[Exception escapes before per-layer handlers]
    REQUEST_TUPLE -->|Success| GEOM_LOOP[Iterate configured geometry layers]

    subgraph GEOMETRY[Per geometry layer]
        GCACHE{Valid layer cache?}
        GCACHE -->|available or empty| GREUSE[Reuse cached result]
        GCACHE -->|miss or invalid| GQUERY[OSMnx features_from_bbox via retry wrapper]
        GQUERY --> GEMPTY{No matching features or empty GDF?}
        GEMPTY -->|Yes| GEMPTY_RESULT[Record empty; cache empty result]
        GEMPTY -->|No| GTRANSFORM[transform_gdf_to_ror]
        GTRANSFORM -->|Success| GAVAILABLE[Record available; cache transformed GDF]
        GTRANSFORM -->|Exception| GFAILED[Record failed at transformation; continue]
        GQUERY -->|Other exception| GQUERY_FAILED[Record failed at acquisition; continue]
    end
    GEOM_LOOP --> GCACHE
    GREUSE --> NETWORK_LOOP[Iterate configured network layers]
    GEMPTY_RESULT --> NETWORK_LOOP
    GAVAILABLE --> NETWORK_LOOP
    GFAILED --> NETWORK_LOOP
    GQUERY_FAILED --> NETWORK_LOOP

    subgraph NETWORK[Per network layer]
        NCACHE{Valid layer cache?}
        NCACHE -->|available or empty| NREUSE[Reuse cached result]
        NCACHE -->|miss or invalid| NQUERY[OSMnx graph_from_bbox via retry wrapper]
        NQUERY --> NTYPE{Roads or non-road network?}
        NTYPE -->|Non-road empty| NEMPTY[Record empty; cache empty result]
        NTYPE -->|Non-road with nodes| NTRANSFORM[transform_graph_to_ror]
        NTRANSFORM -->|Success| NAVAIL[Record available; cache transformed graph]
        NTRANSFORM -->|Exception| NFAIL_TRANSFORM[Record failed at transformation; continue]
        NTYPE -->|Road graph empty| REMPTY[StreetNetworkResult empty]
        NTYPE -->|Road graph with nodes| RTRANSFORM[transform_graph_to_ror and validate graph CRS]
        RTRANSFORM -->|Success| RRESULT[StreetNetworkResult available or nodes-only empty; cache result]
        RTRANSFORM -->|Exception| RFAIL[StreetNetworkResult failed; stage reported as acquisition]
        NQUERY -->|Query exception| NFAIL_QUERY[Non-road failed at acquisition or Road result failed]
    end
    NETWORK_LOOP --> NCACHE
    NETWORK_LOOP -->|After configured network layers| ROADS_CONFIGURED{roads in networks?}
    ROADS_CONFIGURED -->|No| ROADS_NOT_REQUESTED[Do not query roads; assign StreetNetworkResult(status=not_requested)]
    ROADS_NOT_REQUESTED --> BUNDLE_DECISION
    ROADS_CONFIGURED -->|Yes| BUNDLE_DECISION
    NREUSE --> BUNDLE_DECISION
    NEMPTY --> BUNDLE_DECISION
    NAVAIL --> BUNDLE_DECISION
    NFAIL_TRANSFORM --> BUNDLE_DECISION
    REMPTY --> BUNDLE_DECISION
    RRESULT --> BUNDLE_DECISION
    RFAIL --> BUNDLE_DECISION
    NFAIL_QUERY --> BUNDLE_DECISION

    BUNDLE_DECISION{Any requested layer failed?}
    BUNDLE_DECISION -->|No| WRITE_BUNDLE[Write whole-bundle Pickle cache]
    BUNDLE_DECISION -->|Yes| SKIP_BUNDLE[Skip bundle cache; retain successful per-layer cache entries]
    WRITE_BUNDLE -->|Success| RETURN_NEW[Return assembled bundle]
    WRITE_BUNDLE -->|Exception| BUNDLE_CACHE_ERROR[Exception propagates; normal downloader return is not reached]
    SKIP_BUNDLE --> RETURN_NEW
    RETURN_BUNDLE -->|Bounds present| AFTER[dlcity stores session state and attempts elevation preload]
    RETURN_NEW -->|Bounds present| AFTER
    RETURN_BUNDLE -->|Bounds missing| CLEAR_SESSION[dlcity clears map/elevation/world-size state and returns]
    RETURN_NEW -->|Bounds missing| CLEAR_SESSION
    AFTER --> NEXT[Continue CLI flow; outside this acquisition diagram]
